{"title": "Scar of the Agave", "pageid": 33819, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scar_of_the_Agave", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Tactical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp/300px-Generic_Tactical.webp, /w/images/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp/300px-Generic_Tactical.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Generic_Tactical.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Scar of the Agave</b> is a passive feature found only on Gur clerics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When this character is struck by a melee attack while at less than 60% of their <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\">hit points</a>, the attacker takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Katelyn_Lerskin\" title=\"Katelyn Lerskin\">Katelyn Lerskin</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213056\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 732/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4196/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2143/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 148/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643720/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.893      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.893      1 -total\n 39.57%   14.996      1 Template:DamageText\n 34.98%   13.254      1 Template:Damage_type\n 33.76%   12.792      1 Template:Icon_link\n 32.52%   12.324      1 Template:Icon_text\n 30.60%   11.594      7 Template:Trim\n 24.51%    9.286      1 Template:Ifempty\n 13.56%    5.140      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 12.53%    4.747      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:33819-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714213056 and revision id 168551. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}